  "source_palette": "Measured from the supplied SPACES ding and earlier call/support cues. New synthesized arrangements; the existing master ding was not modified.",
  "playback_notes": [
    "Assets are already mastered at quiet relative levels. recommended_volume is an additional linear gain, not a target loudness.",
    "Use decoded WAV buffers for exact loops; the full file includes intentional silence. MP3 is supplied for convenience.",
    "Stop ringtone and outgoing/reconnecting loops immediately on the corresponding state transition; fade out over about 20 ms.",
    "Honor per-category sound controls and existing Do Not Disturb settings.",
    "Do not play both entered_call and reconnected for the same transition, or both left_call and call_ended for one local departure.",
    "Suppress duplicate events and keep participant/viewer cues rate-limited in busy rooms.",
    "Audio assets only. This pack is not installed in the SPACES application."
